  "releaseNotes": "1.3.0:\n- AddBehaviors now validates that an open-generic behavior type implements IPipelineBehavior<,> before registering, instead of failing later with a confusing MakeGenericType exception during DI resolution.\n- AddMediatorFromAssemblies now throws ArgumentNullException for a null element in the assemblies array, instead of an unfriendly NullReferenceException.\n- Publish no longer silently drops an earlier notification handler's failure when a later handler is cancelled (OperationCanceledException/TaskCanceledException) mid-loop; buffered failures and the cancellation are now combined into a single AggregateException. Cancellation with no prior failures still propagates unchanged.\n- Send() no longer allocates a closure/delegate when no pipeline behaviors are registered, matching the documented zero-alloc fast path.",
